<!--
  ZA.Scheduling v2.0.0 - intentional API breaks for the major version bump.

  #283 drops AddScheduling()'s fallback to the reflection-based serializer, so the serializer that
  used to be the default is renamed from DefaultJobSerializer to SystemTextJsonJobSerializer and
  becomes an explicit opt-in. The 1.x DI extension aliases, [Obsolete] under ZASCH001 to ZASCH006,
  are removed. docs/migrating-to-v2.md maps every removed name to its replacement. The generated
  ZASCH010 alias is emitted into consumer assemblies, so it has no entry here.

  #290 removes ISchedulingBuilder.WithMediator(), a no-op kept for source compatibility after the
  generated AddXxxJob() took over registering MediatorJobTypeExecutor. It was the last member of
  MediatorSchedulingExtensions, so the whole type disappears and apicompat reports a type-level
  CP0001 rather than a member-level CP0002.

  Generated by apicompat in suppression-file mode against the 1.4.11 baseline of each package,
  then annotated. Only the removals are listed, so an accidental removal elsewhere still fails
  the job. Delete this file once 2.0.0 is the published baseline.
-->
